# Summary

The handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook [[cite:obs-a50dbc59445c4d6346811e7d7e1d93d4162a8b76 "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

The handbook's parking rule specifies that certain parking spaces are reserved and that there is a time limit for parking. Specifically, spaces numbered twelve through thirty are reserved, and the time limit for parking in these spaces is two hours [[cite:obs-a50dbc59445c4d6346811e7d7e1d93d4162a8b76 "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].